  <titles>
    <title type="display">Mental Health Justice Act of 2026</title>
    <title type="short" as="introduced">Mental Health Justice Act of 2026</title>
    <title type="official" as="introduced">To amend the Public Health Service Act to authorize grants to States, Indian Tribes, Tribal organizations, and political subdivisions thereof to hire, employ, train, and dispatch mental health professionals to respond in lieu of law enforcement officers in emergencies involving one or more persons with a mental illness or an intellectual or developmental disability, and for other purposes.</title>
  </titles>
